            "sid": "NEH 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa ŋuluce lu daadaŋ: Ŋisacaradotin, ŋilepi, ŋiketeok ŋipukei, ŋikaeok, ŋiketiyak ka Akai ka Akuj ka daadaŋ ŋulu apotu totyakaros alotuŋa a ŋakwapin aŋuna ka akiwuap ŋikisila ŋulu ka Akuj, kaapei ka ŋaberu kec, ŋidwe kec ŋulusapa ka ŋulupesur ka daadaŋ ŋulu ayakatar aosou ka ayenut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kimorikin ka ŋiyeneta kec ta ŋikapolok kec tocamut aryamun ŋicen erae pa kiwuap ŋikisila a Akuj ka kikoŋo akiwuap ŋikisila ŋulu ka Akuj, ŋulu ainakini Moses ŋolo arae eketiyan ka Akuj ikes ka akiwuap ejok ŋakiciketa daadaŋ ŋuna ke Ekapolon Akuj yok ka ŋikisila keŋ ka ŋakiro ŋuna etubunit iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyeinakinio isua ŋidwe kosi ŋulupesur kiitarae lotuŋa a ŋakwapin, kori nyiitunio isua ŋidwe kec ŋulupesur aŋuna a ŋidwe kosi a ŋulusapa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosodi ani keyaut ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ŋiboro ŋulu egyelanaryo, kori ŋikinyom ŋidi agyelanar akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, nyegyelio isua ŋiboro ŋul akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, kori akoloŋit adio ŋina asegan, nyitaunio isua ŋinyomen ŋidi ekaru ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei ka etacio isua ŋamicae daadaŋ ekaru ŋol.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
